	(text "Copied from the FCU mainboard (Power Connectors sheet), pin for pin. Only change: 5V_EXT comes from the\nMIC29302 on the power sheet instead of J13. TPS2115A: IN1 = 5V_EXT wins above ~4 V (R201/R202 divider),\nIN2 = USB VBUS otherwise; OUT = +5V. JP1: 1-2 normal (MCU rail VIN on +5V), 2-3 ISP (VIN on J201 VCC only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
